cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in scientific work, please cite the accompanying paper."
type: software
title: "adam-identification"
abstract: >
  Database-grounded LLM agent for identifying atomistic structures (crystals and molecules)
  from natural-language descriptions. The agent extracts a chemical formula using a language
  model, queries the Materials Project (crystals) or PubChem (molecules) for candidates,
  and selects the correct phase or structural isomer. Returns ASE Atoms or pymatgen Structure
  objects ready for first-principles calculations.
